{"id":"916e46a7ff7a4753","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-enumerable.md","title":"Effectively Enumerable","display":"df-enumerable — Effectively Enumerable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-enumerable","aliases":["92-df-enumerable"],"display":"df-enumerable — Effectively Enumerable","depends_on":["[[92-df-theory]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-ce-set]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 57、61（PDF 74、78）","source_status":"本地理论有效性定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-enumerable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-enumerable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-enumerable — Effectively Enumerable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 57、61（PDF 74、78）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地理论有效性定义"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-enumerable-—-Effectively-Enumerable-$\\mathrm{EA}$\">df-enumerable — Effectively Enumerable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EA}\">\\(\\mathrm{EA}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_G\\)</span> (theory parameter and predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (code-set constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computable-enumerability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{EA}_G\\)</span> (definition-target effective-axiomatizability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enumerable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathrm{Code}_G(T))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enumerable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathrm{Code}_G(T))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EA}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{EA}(T)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>是有效可枚举的</li>\n<li>因为这里的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>已经是闭合理论，断言的是其全部定理的码集c.e.；并未断言某个给定公理集原始递归，也不应把“c.e.”擅自加强成“PR”</li>\n<li>第一不完备性定理要求有效可公理化（等价地，在标准有效演算下其定理集c.e.），同时还要求足够算术强度与相应一致性条件</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\\)</span>按定义保证存在算法枚举<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的句子码</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\\)</span> 针对闭合理论定理码集的外部 c.e. 性；原书“enumerable in S”是存在二元公式，在成员处有可证见证、在非成员处所有见证均可反驳，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"58d4ef04d6476ad5\" href=\"?note=58d4ef04d6476ad5\" title=\"92-df-enumerability-in-system\">92-df-enumerability-in-system</a>。两者不可互换。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 57、61（PDF 74、78）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-enumerable-—-Effectively-Enumerable-$\\mathrm{EA}$","text":"df-enumerable — Effectively Enumerable $\\mathrm{EA}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ and $\\mathrm{Theory}_G$ (theory parameter and predicate, see [[92-df-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Code}_G$ (code-set constructor, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computable-enumerability predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-enumerability-in-system","status":"resolved","id":"58d4ef04d6476ad5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本节点的 $\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)$ 针对闭合理论定理码集的外部 c.e. 性；原书“enumerable in S”是存在二元公式，在成员处有可证见证、在非成员处所有见证均可反驳，见[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]。两者不可互换。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{EA}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enumerable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathrm{Code}_G(T))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EA}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)","display":false}],"bytes":1751,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-enumerable]]"}],"outgoing":["87dbd27955ecb3b6","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","69a2a133da01f9c9","58d4ef04d6476ad5"]}